     Bottleneck : CPU FP32 turbo = 56 TFLOPS << GPU total FP32 = 268 TFLOPS
     Ratio      : 5x GPU/CPU
     Mitigation : Offload all FP32 workloads to GPU; CPU handles orchestration only.

  ⚠  PCIe peer fabric (GPU-to-GPU)
     Bottleneck : GPU peer BW over PCIe = 63 GB/s << HBM3 = 2000 GB/s
     Ratio      : 32x HBM/PCIe-peer
     Mitigation : Reduce inter-GPU traffic with tensor/sequence parallel tuning and communication overlap.

